{"channelId":"UCMtTRhiszNSZigjTNlwZQoA","row":["Modoma Health",369,"You are unique - your health care should be too. Based on the\nfact that no two people are alike, Modoma provides a personalized\nand integrated approach to your care. This innovative approach\nspecifically empowers you with the knowledge and support you\nneed to optimize your health.\n\nBy putting you at the center of care, we found that the integrated\nmodel developed around your personalized needs and goals is the\nbest way to achieve optimized health. \n\nWith this in mind, we developed the Modoma Method™ - an evidence-based comprehensive approach around our Pillars Of Health which includes Activity, Recovery, Nutrition, and Lifestyle. \nWe have found that integrating the 4 pillars into our services provides synergistic results that accelerated our patients to achieve their goals.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCMtTRhiszNSZigjTNlwZQoA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCMtTRhiszNSZigjTNlwZQoA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:57.663Z","channelId":"UCMtTRhiszNSZigjTNlwZQoA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"7535a79fe91cb82953c69bba2a3d84317176972df02434fe7ac777a7fdbb2af4","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"ad32c39f38c3b7730db1801c44a3432815b586c01ee84dcf10ab1c8a0967cba1"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCMtTRhiszNSZigjTNlwZQoA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:57.663Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCMtTRhiszNSZigjTNlwZQoA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":369,"raw":"369 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCMtTRhiszNSZigjTNlwZQoA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:57.663Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"massage therapist","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"single_sample","role":"undetermined","f